kairo-logic2d 1
rules 15
main begin print "Recover the first two signals"
main collect add 0 100
main death add 1 1
main complete add 0 50
main ui pause add 2 1
climb begin print "Cross the relay bridge"
climb collect add 0 100
climb death add 1 1
climb complete add 0 50
climb ui pause add 2 1
vault begin print "Open the signal vault"
vault collect add 0 100
vault death add 1 1
vault complete add 0 50
vault ui pause add 2 1
